exports[`CommandThreadRoom > keeps a pending Team question visible after thread rehydration without a false missing-Run failure 1`] = `"<header class="home-title thread-home-title" data-od-id="desktop-command-header"><p>Agent 正在执行</p><h1><span>未命名会话</span></h1></header><section class="command-thread-room" data-od-id="command-thread-room"><main class="transcript"><div class="message-list" role="log" aria-busy="true" aria-live="polite" aria-relevant="additions text"><section class="turn-group team-progress-turn" aria-label="团队任务进度"><article class="message" data-kind="userMessage" data-has-icon="false" data-transcript-variant="message" aria-label="你"><div class="message-body"><div class="message-header"><span class="message-role">你</span><span class="message-type">输入</span></div><div class="markdown-content"><p>核对预算</p></div></div></article><div class="team-progress-status" role="status" data-phase="working"><strong>团队正在协作</strong><ul><li data-status="running"><span>核验员</span><span>执行中</span></li></ul><p>成员完成不代表最终结论已就绪。当前页面负责协调，完成前请勿刷新。</p></div></section><div aria-hidden="true" class="transcript-follow-anchor" data-testid="transcript-follow-anchor"></div></div></main></section>"`;

